      "source": [
        "### Fastest BERT setup for HuffPost\n",
        "Strategy:\n",
        "- DistilBERT pretrained checkpoint\n",
        "- Train on a subset first for speed\n",
        "- Freeze most of backbone\n",
        "- Unfreeze only top 2 transformer blocks\n",
        "- Small LR for stability\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "SLQ7pJWx1PtS"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Hyperparameter Definitions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 13,
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-04-11T20:46:09.600472Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-04-11T20:46:09.599844Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-04-11T20:46:09.604733Z",
